        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Poster on Kie\n\nGenerates a poster-style image and is meant to run on a Kie model. Kie serves several model families behind one key, so this is a quick way to check that your Kie key works.\n\n**How it works:** Describe the scene in \"Subject\". \"Render\" turns it into a 16:9 image at 1K and avoids text, watermarks and logos through its negative prompt. \"Poster\" shows the image.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a Kie image model on \"Render\", then change aspect_ratio to 2:3 for a portrait poster."
        },
